      "text": "→ 🔍 Deduplication: check if this exact long URL was already shortened and return the\nexisting short code\n\n→ 👥 Most shorteners allow multiple short codes for same long URL. Different users may\nwant separate expiration dates, independent analytics, or different custom aliases.\n\n→ ⚖️ Deduplication trades off storage efficiency for these features",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "unKhLpa5-2DrKWeGyiuWI",
      "originalText": "→ 🔍 Deduplication: check if this exact long URL was already shortened and return the existing short code\n\n→ 👥 Most shorteners allow multiple short codes for same long URL. Different users may want separate expiration dates, independent analytics, or different custom aliases.\n\n→ ⚖️ Deduplication trades off storage efficiency for these features",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
