      "seed": 510331184,
      "version": 821,
      "versionNonce": 1346537098,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1775314844938,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "→ 💥 To prevent custom aliases from colliding with future counter-generated codes,\nconsider prefixing generated codes with a character that custom aliases can't use, or store\nthem in separate namespaces\n\n→ 🪶 Prefix approach (like prefixing generated codes with ~ or $) is essentially a\nlightweight version of namespacing — you're encoding the namespace into the value\nitself rather than the storage structure",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Cru_YT4OsL_iLayzv00Iq",
      "originalText": "→ 💥 To prevent custom aliases from colliding with future counter-generated codes, consider prefixing generated codes with a character that custom aliases can't use, or store them in separate namespaces\n\n→ 🪶 Prefix approach (like prefixing generated codes with ~ or $) is essentially a lightweight version of namespacing — you're encoding the namespace into the value itself rather than the storage structure",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
